^67



prathamaḥ paricchedaḥ



namaḥ śrīvajrasattvāya



1.1 yatrābhūtasamastakalpapaṭalāliptaṃ svabhāvāmalaṃ

bauddhaṃ dharmaśarīram apratisamaṃ saddharmavṛddhyāspadam

saṃbhogaṃ ca vicitrarūparacitaṃ saṃnirmitaṃ jāyate

prajñopāyamayaṃ praṇamya tad alaṃ citas tad evocyate



1.2 śrīmatānaṅgavajreṇa saṃkṣepāt tattvato mayā

ajñātatatsvarūpāṇāṃ hitāyaśeṣajanmanām



1.3 abhūtakalpasaṃbhūto bhāvasaṃkalpanātmakaḥ

bhavaḥ sa eva cākhyāto bālavyāmohako budhaiḥ



1.4 tataḥ prajāyate 'śeṣakleśarāśiḥ sduḥsahaḥ

asakṛd vividhaṃ caiva mahatkarmakadambakaḥ



1.5 tābhyāṃ ca maraṇotpādaprabhṛtyatyantavistaram

ajasraṃ jāyate duḥkham aśraddhāsaktacetasām

% -prabhṛtya- em. ed.; -prabhṛtyā- MS



1.6 yāvad bhāvamahāgrāho bhavacāraikavartinām

prajñāhīnatayā tāvat svahitaṃ parahitaṃ na ca



1.7 atas trijagadānandaṃ kartukāmaiḥ svavibhramam

hartukāmaiś ca santy ājyo bhāvagrāho manīṣibhiḥ



^68



1.8 bhāvagrāhaṃ parityajya nābhāvaṃ kalpayed budhaḥ

yadi nāmānayor bhedaḥ kalpanā naiva bhidyate



1.9 varaṃ hi bhāvasaṃkalpo na tv abhāvaprakalpanā

nirvāti jvalito dīpo nirvṛtaḥ kāṃ gatiṃ vrajet



1.10 yāvad bhāvasya saṃkalpas tāvad bhāvo hi lakṣyate

na hy ādirahitasyeha vyomno nidhanasaṃbhavaḥ



1.11 abhāvamātrasādhyo 'pi upāyarahito na ca

svaparārthāsamartho 'sāv abhāvatvāt khapuṣpavat



1.12 evaṃ bhāvaḥ parityājyo bhrāntatvād indrajālavat

abhāvatvād abhāvaś ca buddhatvaphalavāñchibhiḥ



1.13 yathānayoḥ parityāge saṃkṣaye yad avasthitam

asaṃsāram anirvāṇam adhunā śrūyatāṃ budhāḥ

% saṃkṣaye] em. ed.; saṃkṣayo MS

% avasthitam] em. ed.; avasthitaḥ MS



1.14 parāmarśaṇayogena dharmāṇāṃ niḥsvabhāvatā

jñānajñeyavibhāgena prajñātattvaṃ tad ucyate



1.15 rañjaty aśeṣaduḥkhaughān utthāṃs tu duḥkhahetutaḥ

sarvasattvān yatas tasmāt kṛpā rāgaḥ pragīyate



1.16 upānayaty abhimataṃ yan naukevānukūlataḥ

sadānukūlayogena saivopāyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ



1.17 ubhayor melanaṃ yac ca salilakṣīrayor iva

advayākārayogena prajñopāyaḥ sa ucyate



1.18 prakṣeptuṃ cāpanetuṃ ca śakyate yatra naiva hi

prakṣepāya ca yat tyaktaṃ dharmatattvaṃ tad ucyate



^69



1.19 grāhyagrāhakasaṃtyaktaṃ sadasatpakṣavarjitam

lakṣyalakṣaṇanirmuktaṃ śuddhaṃ prkṛtinirmalam



1.20 na dvayaṃ nādvayaṃ śāntaṃ śivaṃ sarvatra saṃsthitam

pratyātmavedyam acalaṃ prajñopāyam anākulam



1.21 tad eva sarvabuddhānām ālayaṃ paramādbhutam

śreyaḥsaṃpatkaraṃ divyaṃ dharmadhātuḥ prakīrtitam



1.22 apratiṣṭhitanirvāṇaṃ tryadhvasaṃbuddhasevitam

svādhiṣṭhānapadaṃ ramyaṃ prajñāpāramitāśivam



1.23 kāyatrayaṃ triyānaṃ ca asaṃkhyā mantrakoṭayaḥ

mudrāmaṇḍalacakraṃ ca kaulikaṃ tad anuttaram



1.24 sarve vinirgatās tasmād devadaityendramānavāḥ

pretādayas tathā cānye nirudhyante ca tatra hi



1.25 cintāmaṇir ivāśeṣajagataḥ sarvadā sthitam

bhuktimuktipadaṃ samyak prajñopāyasvarūpataḥ



1.26 idam eva samāgamya saṃbuddhāḥ sugatāḥ purā

saṃbuddhyante ca sarvatra saṃbhotsyante jagaddhitāḥ



1.27 anantasukharūpatvāt śrīmahāsukhasaṃjñitam

samantabhadram agryaṃ tadabhisaṃbodhikārakam



1.28 trijagadakhiladuḥkhadhvaṃsanaikapravṛtteḥ

anupamakaruṇāyāḥ saṅgayuktāgrabuddheḥ

aparimitavicitrajñeyarāśeḥ samatvaṃ

svaparaparasukhāṅgaṃ tattvam ūcur munīndrāḥ



iti prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhau prajñopāyavipañco nāma prathamaḥ paricchedaḥ



^70



2.1 athātaḥ kathyate  kiṃcit tattvaratnasya labdhaye

hitāya bhavadurbhedabhrāntivyāmohitātmanām



2.2 upāyaḥ pūrvasaṃbhuddhair yathoddiṣṭaḥ samāsataḥ

śrīmatānaṅgavajreṇa karuṇāviṣṭacetasā



2.3 idaṃ tad iti tad vaktuṃ naiva śakyaṃ jinair api

pratyātmavedyarūpatvād bāhyārthena ca gṛhyate



2.4 tathā ca tryadhvasaṃbuddhair jagadānandakārkaiḥ

ākhyāto 'nekasūtrāntamantracaryādiṣu kramāt



2.5 śrutādijñānagamyaṃ tan na bhaved vai kadācana

śabdārthayor asaṃbandhāt śāstralakṣaṇasūcakam



2.6 ata eva sadāsaktyā yuktaṃ sadgurusevanam

na ca tena vinā tattvaṃ prāpyate kalpakṭibhiḥ



2.7 aprāpte tattvaratne tu siddhir naiva kadācana

suviśuddhe 'pi satkṣetre bījābhāvād yathāṅkuraḥ



2.8 sāmnāyāḥ santi ye kecit prajñopāyarthadeśakāḥ

cintāmaṇir ivodbhūtā nirvikalpapathe sthitāḥ



2.9 tattvenaiva parijñāya ācāryān vasudhātale

tān upāsīta yatnena ātmasiddhyagrahetave



^71



2.10 anantabodhisatsaukhyaṃ prāpyate yasya tejasā

śreṣṭhatvaṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ trailokye sacarācare



2.11 tat kimarthaṃ kṛpāmūrtau tatrākāraṇavatsale

māyāmalinacetobhir ḍhaukayanti durāśayāḥ



2.12 asatpraṇāmasatkārair dṛḍhaṃ copāsya sadgurum

kṣīrādidānapūjābhir āyur yāvat samīhitam



2.13 saṃprapte tattvaratne tu sarvabuddhaguṇālaye

vārtām api na pṛcchanti chidrān veṣaṇadāruṇāḥ



2.14 tathānye 'pi durātmāno ḍhaukante guruvajriṇam

viheṭhayanti cātmānam ātmanaiva durāśayāḥ



2.15 haraṇe gurumudrāyā ratnatrayadharasya ca

nirvikalpāḥ pratikṣepyā dharmatāyāś ca yoginaḥ



2.16 uktā śrīvajranāthena samaye tu mahādbhute

jugupsābuddhayo nityaṃ svamātṛtrāsakāriṇaḥ



2.17 upāsyaikaṃ guruṃ pūrvaṃ nānugṛhṇāti mām iti

āśrayanty aparān duṣṭās taddoṣakathānotsukāḥ



2.18 yogitācāryasaṃjñā ca katham asmākam astv iti

etanmātrapravṛttās te buddhatvaṃ prati nārthinaḥ



2.19 kathaṃcit prāpya te jñānaṃ manyante na guruṃ purā

jñātāro vayam ity āhur mattaḥ kecin na cāpare



^72



2.20 anye ca kupitāḥ prāhuḥ gṛhāṇaitat samarpitam

ahaṃ na tava śiṣyo 'smi na bhāan sāṃprataṃ guruḥ



2.21 kutas teṣāṃ bhavet siddhiḥ saukhyaṃ caiveha janmani

guruvañcanacittā ye te bhramanti viḍambitāḥ



2.22 evaṃvidhāś ca ye sattvāḥ svārthasaṃpadbahirmukhāḥ

uktāḥ śrīvajranāthena sarve te 'pāyabhājanāḥ



2.23 na teṣāṃ narakād anyā gatir asty ātmavidviṣām

pacyante ghorakarmāṇo duḥkhair bahuvidhair bhṛśam



2.24 ata eva sadā sadbhir anantaphaladāyakaḥ

ācāryaḥ sarvabhāvena ātmaśreyo 'rthavāñchibhiḥ



2.25 īrṣyāmātsaryam utsṛjya mānāhaṃkāram eva ca

māyāśāṭhyaṃ tathāpāsya saṃbodhau kṛtaniścayaiḥ



2.26 sadā parahitasyaiva caryayākampyacetasā

paryuāsyo jagannātho guruḥ sarvārthasiddhidaḥ



2.27 svakāryanirapekṣaiś ca pūjāmaṇḍalapūrvakaiḥ

trikālaṃ parayā bhaktyā śirasā pādavandanaiḥ



2.28 prāpnuvanti tato 'vighnaṃ gurupādaprasādataḥ

śiṣyāya paramaṃ tattvaṃ tryadhvabuddhair yathoditam



2.29 nityaṃ prabhāsvaraṃ śuddhaṃ bodhicittaṃ jinālayam

sarvadharmamayaṃ divyaṃ nikhilāspadakāraṇam



^73



2.30 dhvastasāndrāndhakārasya saṃnidhānād vivasvataḥ

dhagiti prajvalaty uccaiḥ sūryakāntamaṇir yathā



2.31 saṃnidhānāt jagaddṛṣṭes tattvayogakhararciṣaḥ

jvalatyastamaladhvāntaśiṣyacetomaṇis tathā



2.32 prabodhānantaraṃ śrīmān tattvaratnapradīpitaḥ

daśadiksaṃsthitair buddhaiḥ kāruṇyākṣiptamānasaiḥ



2.33 tūrṇam āgatya saṃbuddhaiḥ śiṣyo 'dhiṣṭhīyate dhrvam

adhiṣṭhānāc ca buddhānāṃ sarvabuddhaiḥ samo bhavet



2.34 mānaṃ śāṭhyaṃ kapaṭapaṭalaṃ sarvam utsṛjya dhīraiḥ

yaiḥ sāmnāyaiḥ gurur asamayaḥ śraddhayā sevyate 'tra

agryāḥ prāptāḥ sakalasugatā yat samāsādya bodhiṃ

nūnaṃ tat tair jinaguṇapadaṃ prāpyate tattvaratnam

% agryāḥ] em. ed.; agrāḥ MS



iti prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhau vajrācāryārādhananirdeśa nāma dvitīyaḥ paricchedaḥ



^74



tṛtīyaḥ paricchedaḥ



3.1 athātaḥ kathyate samyag vajrasattvapadārthinām

sādhakānāṃ hitārthāyābhiṣekaṃ tribhavāspadam



3.2 mantramārgānusāreṇa abhiṣikto yadā budha/h

pratyakṣaṃ sarvabudhānāṃ maṇḍale sugatālaye



3.3 anantalokadhātvīśo grāhyas tathāpi dhīmatā

svādhiṣṭhānakramaṃ prāpya samayakṣatibhīruṇā



3.4 mantramārge tathā proktaṃ saṃbuddhaiḥ paramārthataḥ

vajrasattvādidevānāṃ samayo duratikramaḥ



3.5 athātaḥ sarvayatnenābhiṣekārthaṃ jinātmajaḥ

upasarpya yathāyogaṃ vajrācāryaṃ guṇodadhim

% vajrācāryaṃ] em. ed.; vajrācārya MS



3.6 navayauvanasaṃpannāṃ prāpya mudrāṃ sulocanām

srakcandanasuvastrādyair bhūṣayitvā nivedayet



3.7 gandhamālyādisatkāraiḥ kṣīrapūjādivistaraiḥ

bhaktyā saṃpūjya yatnena mudrayā saha nāyakam



3.8 śiṣyo bhūmau samāropya śraddhayā jānumaṇḍalam

adhyeṣayīta śāstrāraṃ srotreṇānena sāñjaliḥ



3.9 namas te śūnyatāgarbha sarvasaṃkalpavarjita

sarvajña jñānasaṃdoha jñānamūrte namo 'stu te



3.10 jagadajñānavicchediśuddhatattvārthadeśaka

dharmanairātmyasaṃbhūta vajrasattva namo 'stu te



^75



3.11 saṃbuddhā bodhisattvāś ca tvattaḥ pāramitāguṇāḥ

saṃbhavanti sadā nātha bodhicitta mano 'stu te



3.12 ratnatrayaṃ mahāyānaṃ tvattaḥ sthāvarajaṅgamam

traidhātukam idaṃ sarvaṃ jagadvīra namo 'stu te



3.13 cintāmaṇir ivodbhūta jagadiṣṭārthasiddhaye

sugatājñākara śrīman buddhaputra namo 'stu te



3.14 jñātaṃ me 'nuttaraṃ tattvaṃ prasādāt te guṇārṇava

vajrābhiṣekaṃ sarvajña prasādaṃ kuru sāṃpratam



3.15 rahasyaṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ deśitaṃ dharmavajriṇā

yathā śrīcittavajreṇa tathā nātha prasīda me



3.16 bhavatpādambuje tyaktvā nānyā me vidyate gatiḥ

tasmāt kuru dayā[ṃ] nātha saṃsāragatinirjita



3.17 vajrācāryas tataḥ śrīmān sānukampo hitāśayaḥ

samutpādya kṛpāṃ śiṣyam āhūya gaṇamaṇḍale



3.18 pañcakāmaguṇāakīrṇe vitānavitajojjvale

yoginīyogasaṃyukte ghaṇṭākaṇakaṇasvane



3.19 puṣpadhūpākule ramye sraksurāmodasatsukhe

vajrasattvādidevānām ālaye paramādbhute



3.20 mudrāyogaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā ācāryaḥ subhagottamaḥ

niveśya padmabhāṇḍe tu bodhicittaṃ jinālaye



3.21 ucchritaiś cāmaraiś chatrair gāthāmaṅgalagītibhiḥ

mudrāyuktaṃ tataḥ śiṣyam abhiṣiñcet jagatprabhuḥ



^76



3.22 dattvābhiṣekaṃ sadratnam ācāryaḥ parameśvaraḥ

dadyād vai samayaṃ ramyaṃ divyaṃ prakṛtinirmalam



3.23 mahāratnaṃ sakarupūraṃ raktacandanayojitam

kuliśāmbusamāyuktaṃ pañcamaṃ vāksamudbhavam



3.24 idaṃ te samayaṃ vatsa pūrvabuddhair udāhṛtam

pālayasva sadā bhadra saṃvaraṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam



3.25 na hi prāṇivadhaḥ kāryas triratnaṃ mā parijyaja

ācāryas te na saṃtyājyaḥ saṃvaro duratikramaḥ



3.26 bodhicittābhiṣiktāya śiṣyāya vigatainase

anujñāṃ ca tato dadyāt tasmai buddhāgrasūnave



3.27 ābodhimaṇḍaparyantaṃ diśi cakre samantataḥ

pravartayasva sattvāgra dharmacakram anuttaram



3.28 prajñopāyasvarūpātmā cintāmaṇir ivoccakaiḥ

akhinno vigatāsaṅgaḥ sattvārthaṃ kuru sāṃpratam



3.29 prāptābhiṣekaḥ sānujñaḥ kṛtakṛtyaḥ praharṣitaḥ

vadet samudhurāṃ vāṇīṃ jagadānandakāriṇīm



3.30 adya me saphalaṃ janma saphalaṃ jīvitaṃ ca me

adya buddhakule jāte buddhaputro 'smi sāṃpratam



3.31 kalpārṇavān mahāghorāj janmavīcisamākulāt

tārito 'haṃ tvayā nātha kleśapaṅkāt sudustarāt



3.32 niṣpannam iva cātmānaṃ jāne yuṣmatprasādataḥ

bodhaye na ca me kāṅkṣā prahīṇāḥ sarvavāsanāḥ



^77



3.33 nipatya pādayor bhaktyā prahṛṣṭotphullalocanaḥ

yad yad iṣṭataraṃ dravyaṃ tat tad eva nivedayet



3.34 niravagrahacittena guruṇāpi kṛpālunā

śiṣyasya grahaṇārthāya saṃgrāhyaṃ taddhitāya ca



3.35 tataḥ praṇamya saṃpūjya dattvā ca gurudakṣiṇām

evaṃ vijñāpayed bhūyaḥ saṃprāptābhimatāspadaḥ



3.36 adhunā bhava buddhāgrya suprasādo mamāntike

yathā te 'nuttarāṃ bodhiṃ prasādāt sādhayāmy aham



3.37 niṣpādyānuttaraṃ bauddhaṃ padaṃ sarvāgrapūjitam

tatraiva sthāpayiṣyāmi sattvāṃs tribhavavartinaḥ



3.38 deyo 'bhiṣeko vidhibhir yathoktaiḥ śiṣyādhimuktiṃ manasāvagamya

udāragambhīranayadhimuktavācaiva dadyād abhiṣekaratnam



3.39 prāptāśeṣābhiṣekapravarakuliśabhṛtdurlabhātulyasampatsaṃbhogakṣetralakṣmīgrahaṇakṛtamahābodhicittābhiṣekaḥ

labdhānujñas trilokī duritaripujayārambhasaṃnaddhabuddhir

bodhāv āropya cittaṃ vipulam iha caren nirmalaṃ tattvayogī



iti prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhau bodhicittābhiṣekas tṛtīyaḥ paricchedaḥ



^78



caturthaḥ paricchedaḥ



4.1 athātaḥ kathyate spaṣṭaṃ prajñopāyāgrabhāvanā

parārthārabdhavīryāṇāṃ sādhakānāṃ hitāya vai



4.2 yāṃ vibhāvya na saṃsāre ghore dustaravāridhau

nirvāṇe 'pi na niṣṭhanti yogina svārthamātrake



4.3 yasyāḥ prakarṣaparyantaṃ buddhānām amalādbhutā

hānivṛddhivinirmuktā jātā bodhir niruttarā



4.4 pañcaskandhātmakān dharmān nātikrāmati yo na ca

kadācit parigṛhṇāti sarvadharmasamātmatām



4.5 na śūnyabhāvanāṃ kuryān nāpi cāśūnyabhāvanām

na śūnyaṃ saṃtyajed yogī na cāśūnyaṃ parityajet



4.6 aśūnyaśūnyayor grāhee jāyate 'nalpālpanā

parityāge ca saṃkalpas tasmād etad dvayaṃ tyajet



4.7 ubhayagrāhyasaṃtyāgād vinirmukto gatāspadaḥ

aham ity eṣa saṃkalpas tasmād etad dvayaṃ tyajet



4.8 nirvikāro nirāsaṅgo niṣkāṅkṣo gatakalmaṣaḥ

ādyantakalpanāmukto vyomavad bhāvayed budhaḥ



4.9 na cāpi sattvavaimukhyaṃ kartavyaṃ karuṇāvatā

sattvo nāmāsti nāstīti na caivaṃ parikalpayet



4.10 niṣprapañcasvarūpatvāt prajñeti parikīrtyate

cintāmaṇir ivāśeṣasattvārthakaraṇaṃ kṛpā



^79



4.11 nirālambapade prajñā nirālambā mahākṛpā

ekībhūtā dhiyā sārdhaṃ gagane gaganaṃ yathā



4.12 na yatra bhāvakaḥ kaścin nāpi kācid vibhāvanā

bhāvanīyaṃ na caivāsti socyate tattvabhāvanā



4.13 na kartā kaścid atrāsti bhoktā naivātra vidyate

kartṛbhoktṛvinirmuktā paramārthavibhāvanā



4.14 na cātra grāhakaḥ kaścinn na vā kaścit samarpakaḥ

na parihāryam ataḥ kiñcid grāhyaṃ naivātra vidyate



4.15 paśyatāṃ sarvarūpāṇi śṛṇvatāṃ śabdam eva ca

jalpatāṃ hasatāṃ vāpi prāśnatāṃ vividhān rasān



4.16 kurvatāṃ sarvakarmāṇi anyatra gatacetasām

ajasraṃ yogināṃ yogo jāyate tattvavedinām



4.17 etad advayam ity uktaṃ bodhicittam idaṃ param

vajraṃ śrīvajrasattvaṃ ca saṃbuddho bodhir eva ca



4.18 prajñāpāramitā caiṣā sarvapāramitāmayī

samatā ceyam evoktā sarvabuddhāgrabhāvanā



4.19 atraiva sarvam utpannaṃ jagat sthiracalātmakam

anantā bodhisattvāś ca saṃbuddhāḥ śrāvakādayaḥ



4.20 tad eva bhāvayed yogī bhāvābhāvaviyogataḥ

bhāvābhāvavinirmukto bhāvayan sidhyate laghu



4.21 aśeṣadoṣavidveṣī saṃkleśavimukho dhruvam

anantās tasya jāyante śrīmantaḥ saugatā guṇāḥ



^80



4.22 analpasaṅkalpatamo 'bhibhūtaṃ

prapañcanonmattataḍiccalaṃ ca

rāgādidruvāramalāvaliptaṃ

cittaṃ hi saṃsāram uvāca vajrī



4.23 prabhāsvaraṃ kalpanayā vimuktaṃ

prahīṇarāgādimalapralepam

grāhyaṃ na ca grāhakam agrasattvaṃ

tad eva nirvāṇavaraṃ jagāda



4.24 ataś ca nātaḥ param asti kiṃcit

nimittabhūtaṃ bahuduḥkharāśeḥ

anantasaukhyodayahetubhūtaṃ 

mumukṣavo nāsti tataḥ paraṃ ca



4.25 aśeṣaduḥkhakṣayabuddhakakṣaiḥ

saṃbuddhasatsaukhyam avāptukāmaiḥ

cittaṃ sthirīkṛtya vicārya yatnāt

tasya svabhāvaḥ kriyatāṃ svabhāvaḥ



4.26 yāvat kalpatamaḥpaṭena guruṇā ruddhaṃ mano janmināṃ

tāvad duḥkham anantakaṃ virahitaṃ syāt tena yāvat tataḥ

tāvat saukhyam udāram apratisamaṃ tātparyam āryair ataḥ

kārya(?) tatkṣataye svayaṃ suvipulāṃ rakṣanti tatsaṅgatim



iti prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhau tattvabhāvanānāma caturthaḥ paricchedaḥ





^81



5.1 athātaḥ kathyate spaṣṭaṃ saṃkalpāriniṣūdinī

sarvadharmasamudbhūtā tattvacaryā niruttarā



5.2 hitāya buddhaputrāṇāṃ saṃbodhau ye vyavasthitāḥ

tattvato 'naṅgavajreṇa prajñāpāramitā parā



5.3 janmārṇavān mahāghorāj jarādyūrmisamākulāt

tāriṇī sarvabhūtānāṃ naukeva kṣemagāminī



5.4 kṣiprasiddhikarā divyā hṛdyā sarvaguṇodayā

cintāmaṇir ivodbhūtā īpsitārthaprasādhikā



5.5 vinānayā vajradharapraśastayā samastasaṃbuddhaguṇāgrabhūtayā

na jāyate siddhir ato mumukṣavaḥ carantu caryām atulām imāṃ budhāḥ



5.6 murāriśakratripurārivittadabrahmādikābhyarcitapādapaṅkajāḥ

imāṃ caritvā tv aghanāśinīṃ drutaṃ parām avāptāḥ padavīṃ tathāgatāḥ



5.7 sadbhūtacaryā gatiteyam eva śrīvajrasattvena jagaddhitena

anyā vicitrā tu samastanānāvineyalokasya vaśena yā tu



^82



5.8 siddhiḥ prasiddhyaty akhilā yathoktā vicitracaryābhir anuttarā tu

samantabhadrātulasiddhir āryā saiveti vajrī bhagavān jagāda



5.9 praṇamya sarvathā nātha.ṃ śrīmādācāryavajriṇam

ācrayed guhyacaryāṃ tu kṛtakṛtyo mahāmatiḥ



5.10 tataḥ svacchandam ābhūya sarvāsaṅgabahirmukhaḥ

vicaret tattvayuktātmā kesarīva samantataḥ



5.11 yathābhūtārthasaṃvetā jagaduddharaṇāśayaḥ

samyagdṛṣṭipravṛttātmā dṛḍhacitto nirāśrayaḥ



5.12 svapnamāyopamaṃ sarvaṃ skandhadhātvādilakṣaṇam

traidhātukam idaṃ tadvad jñātvetthaṃ ca samāsataḥ



5.13 kaukṛtyastyānamiddhaṃ tu jīvitaiśvaryam eva ca

tathāṣṭalokadharmaṃ ca sarvaṃ tyaktvātidūrataḥ



5.14 aprakampaḥ sadā bhūtvā nirdvandvaḥ kṛtaniścayaḥ

ṣaṭpāramitāyogena buddhasiddhiprasiddhaye



5.15 sattvārthe 'tiśayāsakto na sattvaparikalpakaḥ

bodhāv āropya cittaṃ tu tattvacaryāṃ samāśrayet



5.16 prajñopāyasuyuktātmā sarvāsaṅgaparāṅmukhaḥ

janmanīhaiva sidhyeta tattvābhyāsakṛtaśramaḥ



^83



5.17 cittānukūlayogena svādhiṣṭhānapradīpitaḥ

ācaret samayaṃ kṛtsnaṃ mantramārgaprakāśitam



5.18 vighnamārādiśāntyarthaṃ pañcāmṛtam adhiśrayet

eṣā tv anuttarā rakṣā viṇmūtrādivyavasthitā



5.19 jvarā garā viṣā rogā ḍākinyupadravagrahāḥ

mārā vināyakāś caiva praśamaṃ yānty anena hi



5.20 narodbhavaṃ tathāśvaṃ ca auṣṭraṃ mātaṅgasaṃbhavam

pradīpaṃ bhakṣayet prājñaḥ śvānam eva ca pañcamam



5.21 anyaiś ca samayair divyaiś cittasyotkarṣakārakaiḥ

mārutakṣobhaśāntyarthaṃ prīṇayet cittavajriṇam



5.22 prajñāpāramitā sevyā sarvathā muktikāṅkṣibhiḥ

paramārthe sthitā śuddhā saṃvṛtyā tanudhāriṇī



5.23 lalanārūpam āsthāya sarvatraiva vyavasthitā

ato 'rthaṃ vajranāthena proktā bāhyārthasaṃbhavā



5.24 brāhmaṇādikulotpannāṃ mudrāṃ vai antyajodbhavām

duḥśīlāṃ parabhāryāṃ ca vikṛtāṃ vikalāṃ tathā



5.25 janayitrīṃ svasāraṃ ca svaputrīṃ bhāgineyikām

kāmayan tattvayogena laghu sidhyeta sādhakaḥ



5.26 vaṃśādisaṃbhavaiḥ śravyaiś cittasyotkarṣakārakaiḥ

karaṇair vādyamudrābhir nānārasaviceṣṭitaiḥ



5.27 svādhidaivatayogena pañcakāmaguṇair varaiḥ

harṣārthaṃ cittaratnasya ātmānaṃ pūjayet sadā



^84



5.28 pradīpāmbujavajrāmbukṣīrapūjādivistaraiḥ

srakcandanasuvastrādyaiś cittasyānandakārakaiḥ



5.29 gamyāgamyādisaṃkalpaṃ nātra kuryāt kadācana

māyopamādiyogena bhoktavyaṃ sarvam eva hi



5.30 dharmadhātusamudbhūtā na kecit paripanthinaḥ

prabhñjīta yathākāmaṃ nirviśāṅkena cetasā



5.31 saṃbhogārtham idaṃ sarvaṃ traidhātukam aśeṣataḥ

nirmitaṃ vajrasattvena sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca



5.32 anantajñānasaṃprāptān vandayen na tathāgatān

satataṃ bhāvanāsiddhyā niṣiktādiṣu kā kathā



5.33 sarvabhāvasvabhāvo 'yaṃ bodhicittasvarūpataḥ

sa eva bhagavān vajrī tasmād ātmaiva devatā



5.34 maṇḍalenopavāsena mudrayā caityakarmaṇā

āhutyā mantrajāpena pustakāghoṣaṇena ca



5.35 śrīmatā vajrasattvena ye 'pi cānye nidarśitāḥ

adhimuktivaśāḥ kecit taiś ca kiṃ tattvavedinaḥ



5.36 amṛtārthī yathā takraṃ sāram ādāya saṃtyajet

evaṃ dharmāmṛtaṃ prāpya tyajen niḥśeṣakalpanām



5.37 nirvikalpo yadā dhīmān tyaktāsaṅgo nirāspadaḥ

tadā siddhyen na saṃdehaś cittaṃ vajravaco yathā



^85



5.38 mudrāliṅganasaṃyogād vajrāveśapravartanāt

sakṣīradharapānāc ca tatkaṇṭhadhvanidīpanāt



5.39 vipulānandasaṃbhogāt tadūrūsphoṭanāt dhruvam

na cirān manmatho rājā vajrasattvaḥ prasiddhyati



5.40 tathā tathā pravarteta yathā na kṣubhyate manaḥ

saṃkṣubdhe cittaratne tu siddhir naiva kadācana



5.41 tasmāt siddhiṃ parām icchan sādhako vigatāgrahaḥ

cittānukūlayogena sādhayet paramaṃ padam



5.42 gomayādhārayogena sūtraṃ saṃdhāryate yathā

cittasūtraṃ tathā dhāryam upāyādhārayogataḥ



5.43 yena tena prayogeṇa yatra tatra vyavasthitaḥ

kālasaṃkhyāṃ parityajya tattvavedī prasiddhyati



5.44 pratidinam advayam asamaṃ yo 'niśam anusevate tritattvāgram

vajropamam amalam asau kāyaṃ chāyopamaṃ labhate



5.45 āmṛṣyetthaṃ hi dhīmān prakṛtisuvipulān prajñayā sarvadharmān

cchettuṃ trailokyaduḥkhaṃ pratidinasumahadvīryasaṃnāhanaddhaḥ

dhyāyet śrīvajrasattvaṃ sakalaguṇanidhiṃ sarvabhāvasvabhāvaṃ

cittaṃ cāropya bodhau viṣayasukharataḥ siddhyatīhaiva dhāmni



5.46 anāspadāḥ kalpanayā vimuktāḥ 

svabhāvataḥ śuddhatamāḥ samastāḥ

anātmasaṃjñāviṣayāḥ prakṛtyā

svapnendrajālapratibhāsatulyāḥ



^86



5.47 yadāvabuddhā niravagraheṇa

cittena sadbhir vipulāśayais tu

tadābhibhūtāḥ sahajāvagatyā

na bādhanājālamalī bhavanti



5.48 lābhālābhe ca yeṣām ayaśasi yaśasi sphāriduḥkhe sukhe ca

nindāyāṃ saṃstutau ca kṣatasakalamalaṃ tulyam eva svacetaḥ

muktaṃ sarvair vikalpair jagati sakaruṇaṃ caryayā naiva saktaṃ

yuktaṃ teṣāṃ karasthaṃ sugatapadam iti proktavān vajrasattvaḥ



5.49 durjahamukhakuṭilotkaṭakoṭaraniryātadurvacobhujaṅgam

ke na bibhedti parāhitakāritam atighorakarmāṇam



5.50 manoharaṃ bhūrisubhāṣitāmṛtaṃ 

asajjanānāṃ manase na rocate

sunirmalānandigabhastimālikāḥ

saroruhaṃ notsahate himārciṣaḥ



5.51 tad eva santaḥ sujanasya mānasaṃ 

rasārdramasrānvitam īkṣaṇaṃ ca

karoti candrāṃśuvitānasaṅgamāt

kṣaraty atīvāmṛtam indukāntiḥ



5.52 ato 'ham āryāḥ kṛtasaṃpuṭāñjalir

vicakṣaṇāḥ sajjanadharmatāsthitāḥ

samarpayāmi pravaraṃ bhavacchidaṃ

samāsato yad racitaṃ mayā sphutam



^87



5.53 śrīvajrasattvena yathoditaṃ ca

tathaiva nirdiṣṭam idaṃ mayāpi

athāsti vaiguṇyam udāhṛtasya

kṣantavyamāryais tadapīti yāce



5.54 gurucaraṇāmbujasevāviṭhayitam amṛtaṃ śubhākarākhyena

yan me tad akhilajagatāṃ vihitaṃ sādhāraṇaṃ kṛpayā



5.55 śrīmattrailokyarājñaḥ pravaraguṇanirdher devadaityendramauleḥ

kṛtvā tattvānuviddhaṃ drutataraphaladaṃ sādhanaṃ yan mayātra

prāptaṃ puṇyaṃ viśālaṃ vimalaguṇa nidher hetubhūtaṃ suyuktaṃ

jitvā kalpāricakraṃ bhavatu jagad idaṃ bodhicittena tena



iti prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhau tattvacaryānirdeśo nāma pañcamaḥ paricchedaḥ.



prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhiḥ samāptā.



kṛtir iyam anaṅgavajrapādānām



